<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0487_T06R0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m the Fishin’ Dude, oldest of the\nFishin’ Bros. We all fish. That’s it.\rYou met the Fishin’ Guru at Lake of\nRage?\rHe dream about seein’ the world’s\nbiggest MAGIKARP. It’s a sad dream.\rCould you show him any MAGIKARP you\ncatch?\rWho knows, you might make his dream\ncome true. He’s been waitin’ 40\fyears.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0487_T06R0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You found somethin’ between the\npages...\rIt’s a pic of people fishin’... They\nlook EXACTLY the same!\fFishin’ Bros. Same face. Same hat.</language>
	</row>
</body>
